          "text": "```java\npublic static byte[] mergeLocalFileDataData(final ZipExtraField[] data) {\n    final boolean lastIsUnparseable = data.length > 0\n            && data[data.length - 1] instanceof UnparseableExtraFieldData;\n    final int regularFieldCount = lastIsUnparseable\n            ? data.length - 1 : data.length;\n\n    int totalLength = WORD * regularFieldCount;\n    for (final ZipExtraField field : data) {\n        totalLength += field.getLocalFileDataLength().getValue();\n    }\n\n    final byte[] result = new byte[totalLength];\n    int offset = 0;\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < regularFieldCount; i++) {\n        final ZipExtraField field = data[i];\n\n        System.arraycopy(field.getHeaderId().getBytes(), 0, result, offset, 2);\n        System.arraycopy(field.getLocalFileDataLength().getBytes(),\n                0, result, offset + 2, 2);\n        offset += WORD;\n\n        final byte[] localData = field.getLocalFileDataData();\n        if (localData != null) {\n            System.arraycopy(localData, 0, result, offset, localData.length);\n            offset += localData.length;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Unparseable trailing data has no header or length prefix.\n    if (lastIsUnparseable) {\n        final byte[] localData = data[data.length - 1].getLocalFileDataData();\n        if (localData != null) {\n            System.arraycopy(localData, 0, result, offset, localData.length);\n        }\n    }\n\n    return result;\n}\n```"
